Hi,

right now I updated hda-emu to version 0.0.3.
hda-emu is a HD-audio emulation program that is hopefully useful for
testing and debugging HD-audio drivers.
This version contains a simple PCM test in addition to handling of
control elements.

The latest package is found at
  ftp://ftp.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/tiwai/misc/hda-emu-0.0.3.tar.gz

The git tree is
  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/hda-emu.git
   
Any fixes, improvements and feedbacks are appreciated


thanks,

